{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 74563, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 53398, "uid": 75614, "type": 4, "title": "raid初阶手操教学", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1619183448, "updated_at": 1642400736, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1653807134, "last_at": 1684831249, "comment_count": 22, "status": 1, "summary": "1.前言在天命之子中，raid斩车一向被视为pve玩家的重要游戏体验【小知识：一票做到消耗单个满级满血量raid老板的血条，叫做斩车】，但是，往往存在技能预设后，无法全自动斩车的情况，这时候就要使用手", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185876668_62876002.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185945695_50109233.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185117261_4483913.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 15, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 23842, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 7, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 74563, "content": "<div id=\"false\"><br></div><div><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">1.前言</span></p></div></span><br></div><div><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 在天命之子中，raid斩车一向被视为pve玩家的重要游戏体验</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">【小知识：一票做到消耗单个满级满血量raid老板的血条，叫做斩车】</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">但是，往往存在技能预设后，无法全自动斩车的情况</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">，这时候就要使用手操斩车。需要注意的是，国际服没有韩服的缝合怪辅助，如单体破防或者快速刷条，</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">因此手操套路不算多，比较简单。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;text-align:center;font-size:20px;\">纯萌新请加群：</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:700;text-align:center;font-size:20px;\">587777772，方便入门</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">2.手操原因</span></p></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此方法主要面向中等练度玩家，也就是在raid中距离斩车伤害还缺临门一脚的玩家</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 初阶手动操作主要指通过连点器进行ft操作，<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">一方面可以快速结束ft节约时间</span><span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);\">【小知识：ds条满百分之百后进入ft时间，选定天子打击敌方固定70下，伤害由ts伤害决定，速度由点击频率决定】</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">另一方面，</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">可以防止ft时间过长掉伤害增幅buff，从而提升ft整体伤害</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">另外，还有进阶手操，面向竞速玩家，如：</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(51,51,51);\">中阶手操是全程auto，由自己释放ds，这样可以减少ds条的充能浪费，加快进ft时间<span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">【小知识：dc的电脑AI释放必杀技的机制为：必杀技ds条满后，仍会把已经充能完毕的天子技能释放完后再打必杀技，这样会浪费ds条充能量，拖延进入下一个ds的时间】</span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"\">高<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">阶手操是全程</span></span>manual，由自己强制释放所有ts，ss和ds，最大限度加快斩车速度<span style=\"color:rgb(177,56,206);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">【同理，pvp中进行强制手操，也会比电脑AI释放更加迅速，从而提高胜率】</span></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span><br></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span><span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">3.初阶手操方法</span></p></div></span><br></span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">你只需要准备<span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">①客户端【电脑和手机都可以】<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">②连点器软件</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">拿电脑举例，雷电模拟器自带了连点器功能</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">步骤一：下载雷电模拟器，安装好dc客户端</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185041036_58532064.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185041036_58532064.png\" style=\"height: 916.868px; width: 534px;\" alt=\"raid初阶手操教学\"></div></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></b></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">步骤二：点击右上角“按键”功</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">能</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185117261_4483913.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185117261_4483913.png\" style=\"height: 622.931px; width: 537.048px;\" alt=\"raid初阶手操教学\"></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></b></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">步骤三：将“连击”拖拽到我们需要打ft的天子图标上</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185945695_50109233.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185945695_50109233.png\" style=\"height: 616.547px; width: 531.556px;\" alt=\"raid初阶手操教学\"></div></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none;\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></b></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">步骤四：输入每秒点击次数【最多60次】与释放的快捷键【如空格】</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185876668_62876002.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1619185876668_62876002.png\" style=\"height: 599.931px; width: 517.22px;\" alt=\"raid初阶手操教学\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><b style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; box-sizing: border-box; text-size-adjust: none;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></b></span><br></div></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">步骤五：在实战中，当ds条满时，按住快捷键，即可快速连点，结束ft</span><br></div><d